title: "encoders: audio & text embedding models (GE2E speaker encoder + bge-m3 text encoder / RAG)"
abstract: >-
  Embedding-models project built on the `BaseModel` interface : a GE2E-trained audio
  encoder for speaker verification and a bge-m3 text encoder with a RAG layer
  (vector database + semantic search) — part of the yui-mhcp projects.
